<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>PrompTugal: the Algarve's case</title>
<meta name="description" content="Why PrompTugal, an Algarvian startup, is good for the Algarve: news, distribution, talent, jobs and startups, connected. Investor deck 4 of 4, November 2026.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="deck.css">
<style>
  .feed { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--hair); border-top: 8px solid var(--red); padding: 10px 34px 14px; }
  .feed .it { padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair); }
  .feed .it:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .feed .d { font: 500 19px/1.2 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); }
  .feed .t { font: 600 30px/1.2 var(--serif); margin: 8px 0 6px; color: var(--ink); }
  .feed .s { font: 400 20px/1.35 var(--mono); color: var(--ink-3); }
  .feed .lbl { font: 500 20px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); padding: 18px 0 8px; }
  .mini h3 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 8px; } .mini p { font: 400 23px/1.42 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .mini { border-left: 6px solid var(--green); padding: 4px 0 4px 26px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .mini.r { border-left-color: var(--red); } .mini.c { border-left-color: var(--cobalt); }
  .jobs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px 40px; margin-top: 44px; }
  .jobs div { font: 400 23px/1.38 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); border-top: 3px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 14px; }
  .jobs div b { display: block; font: 600 30px/1.15 var(--serif); color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .bigstat .v { font: 600 150px/0.95 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .bigstat .l { font: 400 26px/1.35 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 14px; }
  .slide.ink .bigstat .l { color: #c8c4ba; }
  .smallstat .v { font: 600 66px/1 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.02em; } .smallstat .l { font: 400 21px/1.35 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 8px; }
  .lbl2 { font: 500 20px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .ask { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--hair); padding: 30px 30px 32px; position: relative; }
  .ask .q { font: 600 italic 30px/1.25 var(--serif); color: var(--ink); margin: 12px 0 14px; }
  .ask p { font: 400 22px/1.42 var(--sans); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .ask .n { font: 600 64px/1 var(--serif); color: var(--green); }
</style></head>
<body><main class="deck">

<!-- 1 · cover -->
<section class="slide pic">
  <img class="bg" src="img/hero-algarve.jpg" alt="">
  <div class="veil"></div>
  <div class="head"><span><b>Investors</b> · deck 4 of 4</span><span>v1.0 · 7 November 2026</span></div>
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="kicker">The Algarve's case</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:100px;color:#fff">A news company from the Algarve, built to connect the Algarve.</h1>
    <p class="lead">PrompTugal tells the region's technology story, carries it to Lisbon, Europe and AI agents, maps its talent and helps start its startups. Work done from the Algarve.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The Algarve</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 2 · a company from the Algarve -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The company</b></span><span>02</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">An Algarvian startup</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:70px">Incorporated in Loulé. Building here. Joining the region's ecosystem.</h2>
  <div class="cols w40 center" style="margin-top:44px;gap:70px">
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li><b>My Feeds</b> (MYFEEDS AI, UNIPESSOAL, LDA), incorporated in Portugal on 22 October 2025, seat in Loulé, district of Faro.</li>
      <li><b>The publisher of PrompTugal.news,</b> expected to take the PrompTugal name.</li>
      <li><b>Dinis Cruz,</b> sole director and 100% shareholder.</li>
      <li><b>Joining Algarve Evolution</b> as a company, and looking for investors and business partners.</li>
    </ul>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 820 520" width="820" height="520">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="820" height="520" fill="#dfe8ec"/>
      <text x="30" y="480" class="mono" font-size="20" fill="#3f6b82" letter-spacing="3">ATLANTIC OCEAN</text>
      <g transform="translate(40,40)">
        <path d="M5,371 L92,161 L97,70 L184,70 L368,91 L506,70 L644,21 L690,35 L713,140 L727,252 L621,294 L534,364 L520,406 L492,371 L405,336 L345,322 L294,322 L212,294 L152,315 L28,378 Z" fill="#f6f3ec" stroke="#595c64" stroke-width="2"/>
        <g font-size="20" fill="#3f424a">
          <circle cx="152" cy="315" r="7" fill="#595c64"/><text x="140" y="300" text-anchor="end">Lagos</text>
          <circle cx="212" cy="294" r="7" fill="#595c64"/><text x="212" y="278" text-anchor="middle">Portimão</text>
          <circle cx="345" cy="322" r="7" fill="#595c64"/><text x="345" y="358" text-anchor="middle">Albufeira</text>
          <circle cx="492" cy="371" r="9" fill="#006600"/><text x="470" y="402" text-anchor="end" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Faro</text>
          <circle cx="621" cy="294" r="7" fill="#595c64"/><text x="621" y="278" text-anchor="middle">Tavira</text>
        </g>
        <circle cx="451" cy="282" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="3" opacity=".5"/>
        <circle cx="451" cy="282" r="14" fill="#c52830"/>
        <text x="451" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="34" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Loulé</text>
        <text x="451" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#c52830" letter-spacing="1">MY FEEDS · SEAT</text>
        <text x="380" y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="mono" font-size="20" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">↑ LISBON · WEB SUMMIT</text>
      </g>
      <text x="790" y="40" text-anchor="end" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#595c64">THE ALGARVE (SCHEMATIC)</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="src">Company facts as cited from the business registers by web-summit.sgit.ai/investors/company/; ownership and membership from Dinis Cruz, 7 November 2026.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The Algarve</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 3 · the region's own goal -->
<section class="slide ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The region's goal</b></span><span>03</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Algarve Evolution's mandate: diversify the economy beyond tourism</div>
  <h2 style="color:var(--paper);font-size:68px">The Algarve has set itself a target for 2032. We want to help it get there.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:56px;gap:50px">
    <div class="stat bigstat" style="border-left-color:#ff7a7f"><div class="v">500</div><div class="l">companies to support</div></div>
    <div class="stat bigstat" style="border-left-color:#ff7a7f"><div class="v">150</div><div class="l">startups to help create</div></div>
    <div class="stat bigstat" style="border-left-color:#ff7a7f"><div class="v">50,000</div><div class="l">people to reach</div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font:500 20px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#9a978f;margin:60px 0 26px;text-transform:uppercase">So far, as Algarve Evolution reports it</div>
  <div class="cols c4" style="margin-top:0;gap:40px">
    <div class="stat smallstat"><div class="v">2018</div><div class="l">a small group of local entrepreneurs begins</div></div>
    <div class="stat smallstat"><div class="v">118</div><div class="l">active members (1 Nov 2026)</div></div>
    <div class="stat smallstat"><div class="v">142+</div><div class="l">events in 2024 and 2025</div></div>
    <div class="stat smallstat"><div class="v">5,597</div><div class="l">participants at those events</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="src" style="color:#9a978f;margin-top:34px">Targets, not results. Figures are self-reported by Algarve Evolution and not verified by us: Portugal Startup News, 1 Nov 2026; algarveevolution.pt; read 6 Nov 2026 (promptugal.news/portugal/algarve-evolution/).</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The Algarve</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 4 · the gap: connect the dots -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The gap</b></span><span>04</span></div>
  <div class="kicker red">The Algarve's tech story is scattered</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:64px">Everything is here. Nobody can see it whole. We connect the dots.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 600" width="1680" height="600" style="margin-top:20px">
    <defs><marker id="ar4" markerWidth="14" markerHeight="14" refX="12" refY="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L14,7 L0,14 z" fill="#006600"/></marker></defs>
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="600" fill="#ece7db"/>
