<!-- 9 · helping start startups -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>Startups</b></span><span>09</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Helping start the Algarve's startups</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:68px">Everything we build is open: a founder here can start from it.</h2>
  <div class="flow" style="margin-top:50px">
    <div class="step"><div class="n">1</div><h3>Open-source technology</h3><p>Code under Apache-2.0, text and data under CC BY 4.0. Or dual-licensed, on a company's own terms, and maintained by us.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">2</div><h3>The method</h3><p>How a small team runs agents with names, keys, written limits and budgets, step by step on the record.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><h3>A platform to launch on</h3><p>Pages, data, sign-in, payments and distribution, ready for a new edition or a new product.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">4</div><h3>Build days</h3><p>Days of building with AI, together, in the region, with what was built written up.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cols tight" style="margin-top:56px;gap:40px">
    <div class="card r"><div class="n">ALREADY COVERED</div><h3>Vibathon Algarve 2026</h3><p>"A sold-out day of building with AI in Faro", covered by Dinis Cruz's newsroom.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">ALREADY WRITTEN</div><h3>A session programme for Algarve Evolution</h3><p>Written by the same newsroom; both on newsroom.sgit.ai, 31 October 2026.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The Algarve · licences and dual licensing: open-source.sgit.ai</span></div>
</section>

