<!-- 12 · what we ask of the ecosystem -->
<section class="slide v">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What we ask</b></span><span>12</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Of the Algarve's ecosystem</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:68px">We are new here as a company. Tell us what exists, and work with us.</h2>
  <div class="cols c4" style="margin-top:56px;gap:28px">
    <div class="ask" style="border-top:8px solid var(--green)"><div class="n">1</div><div class="q">Which grants and programmes fit?</div><p>Regional, Portuguese and European: we will apply, and want to know where to start.</p></div>
    <div class="ask" style="border-top:8px solid var(--red)"><div class="n">2</div><div class="q">Who will partner with us?</div><p>Business partners and investors who want a news and technology company in the region.</p></div>
    <div class="ask" style="border-top:8px solid var(--cobalt)"><div class="n">3</div><div class="q">Who should we meet?</div><p>Introductions to the startups, companies, schools and bodies whose story we should tell.</p></div>
    <div class="ask" style="border-top:8px solid var(--ink)"><div class="n">4</div><div class="q">Whose event can we cover?</div><p>First customers: events in the region that want their programme, people and news mapped.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:56px">And correct us. <b>Every page we publish about the Algarve is meant to be corrected and added to by the people it is about.</b></p>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The Algarve</span></div>
